abstract: >-
  Reproducibility repository containing analysis code, provenance information,
  reported outputs, and clearly separated exploratory analyses supporting the
  study of VITT-associated antibody sequence features in healthy human B-cell
  repertoires. Raw OAS sequence data are not redistributed.
